<title>BRAZIL: Light year profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Light year profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Rio de Janeiro power utility Light posted the following 1996 results, its first annual results since the company was privatized in May 1996.</p>
<p>				 1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Net profit	   173.3 million	     loss 111.4 million</p>
<p>    Shr profit	   16.68		   loss 10.72</p>
<p>    Net revs	     1.58 bln		1.25 bln</p>
<p>Note: All figures in Brazilian reais and according to Brazilian General Accounting Principles.</p>
<p>Share profit per lots of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro Newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
</text>
